OL,3,GNEWSAOverrunning roadworks shut A14
OL,4,
OL,5,FPart of the A14 in Cambridgeshire was
OL,6,Fshut on Tuesday morning due to
OL,7,Foverrunning roadworks.
OL,9,FAn issue with the tarmac being laid
OL,10,Fmeant the westbound carriageway was
OL,11,Fclosed between junction 22, Brampton
OL,12,FInterchange and junction 13, for
OL,13,FThrapston in Northamptonshire, "into
OL,14,Fthe morning peak travel period",
OL,15,FNational Highways said.
OL,17,FDiversions were in place during the
OL,18,Fextended closure.
OL,20,FThe road was closed until shortly
OL,21,Fbefore 09:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
